{"seq":1,"slug":"viewport-window","title":"可视区与窗口计算：由 scrollTop 求出该渲染哪一段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/windowing/viewport-window","wordCount":1182,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"可视区与窗口计算-由-scrolltop-求出该渲染哪一段\">可视区与窗口计算：由 scrollTop 求出该渲染哪一段</h1><p>虚拟滚动的每一次滚动事件，本质上只回答一个问题：现在应该把哪一段索引的项渲染出来？这个问题的答案由三个量决定——容器当前的滚动位置 <code>scrollTop</code>、容器的可视高度 <code>clientHeight</code>、以及每一项的高度。把这三者关系理清，你就掌握了所有虚拟滚动实现的数学骨架，无论定高还是不定高、无论用哪个库，核心都是这套坐标换算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>设想一条无限长的「内容带」，总高度是所有项高度之和。滚动容器像一个开在这条带子上的取景框，<code>scrollTop</code> 是取景框上沿在内容带上的位置，取景框的高度是 <code>clientHeight</code>。可视区就是内容带上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[scrollTop,\\ scrollTop + clientHeight]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 这一段区间，落在这段区间里的项就是要渲染的项。</p>\n<p>记第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 项的顶部偏移为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>offset</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{offset}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（即它前面所有项的高度之和），高度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 项与可视区相交的条件是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>offset</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>且</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>offset</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{offset}(i) + h_i &gt; scrollTop \\quad \\text{且} \\quad \\text{offset}(i) &lt; scrollTop + clientHeight</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由此可求出可见范围的起止索引 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>start</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> end</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{start},\\ \\text{end}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">start</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">end</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。整个虚拟滚动就是在每次滚动时重算这个区间，再叠加缓冲区，最后把窗口内的项渲染到正确的偏移位置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[scroll 事件] --&gt; B[读取 scrollTop / clientHeight]&#10;  B --&gt; C[求 start: 首个底部越过 scrollTop 的项]&#10;  B --&gt; D[求 end: 首个顶部越过 scrollTop+clientHeight 的项]&#10;  C --&gt; E[叠加 overscan 缓冲]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[渲染 start..end 的项]&#10;  F --&gt; G[为每项设置偏移&lt;br/&gt;transform 或绝对定位]&#10;  G --&gt; H[占位元素维持总高度]\">flowchart TD\n  A[scroll 事件] --&gt; B[读取 scrollTop / clientHeight]\n  B --&gt; C[求 start: 首个底部越过 scrollTop 的项]\n  B --&gt; D[求 end: 首个顶部越过 scrollTop+clientHeight 的项]\n  C --&gt; E[叠加 overscan 缓冲]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[渲染 start..end 的项]\n  F --&gt; G[为每项设置偏移&lt;br/&gt;transform 或绝对定位]\n  G --&gt; H[占位元素维持总高度]</pre><p>窗口计算涉及的核心量一览：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>符号/量</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>scrollTop</code></td>\n<td>容器已滚动的距离</td>\n<td>滚动事件读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>clientHeight</code></td>\n<td>容器可视高度</td>\n<td>布局读取（<code>ResizeObserver</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>offset</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{offset}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 项顶部偏移</td>\n<td>定高为乘法、不定高为前缀和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 项高度</td>\n<td>定高恒定、不定高需测量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>start</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>end</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{start},\\text{end}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">start</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">end</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可见项索引区间</td>\n<td>由上述量求出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>totalSize</td>\n<td>全部项高度之和</td>\n<td>撑起占位/滚动条</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三个不变量\">三个不变量</h2><p>一个正确的虚拟滚动实现必须始终维持三条不变量，任何一条被破坏都会导致滚动条错乱或内容错位。第一，<strong>总高度不变量</strong>：容器内可滚动内容的总高度必须精确等于所有项高度之和，否则滚动条长度和可滚动范围就错了——不定高场景下这一点尤其难，因为未测量项的高度只是估算值。第二，<strong>偏移一致性</strong>：每个被渲染项摆放的位置必须恰好等于它的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>offset</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{offset}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，否则项之间会重叠或留缝。第三，<strong>区间连续性</strong>：渲染的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>start</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>end</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{start}, \\text{end}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">start</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">end</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 必须完整覆盖可视区，不能漏项（露白）也不该无谓地多渲染（浪费）——缓冲区是对这条的有意松弛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"如何摆放窗口内的项\">如何摆放窗口内的项</h2><p>算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>start</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>end</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{start}, \\text{end}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">start</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">end</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 后，还要把这几项摆到正确的纵向位置。有两种主流做法。一种是<strong>绝对定位</strong>：给每个项 <code>position: absolute; top: offset(i)px</code>，容器 <code>position: relative</code> 并撑到 totalSize 高。另一种是<strong>单一偏移 + transform</strong>：外层一个撑高的占位容器，内层一个 <code>transform: translateY(offset(start)px)</code> 的滑块，滑块里正常流式排列 start..end 的项。后者的优点是只需一次 transform、且 transform 走合成层不触发布局，通常更顺滑；前者在项高度差异大时更灵活。这两种摆放方式和节点如何复用密切相关，详见 <a href=\"../techniques/node-recycling\">节点回收与池化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滚动事件的节流与时序\">滚动事件的节流与时序</h2><p><code>scroll</code> 事件在快速滚动时会以很高频率触发，若每次都做完整窗口计算与 DOM 更新，主线程会被打满。实践中有两条对策：一是把窗口重算放进 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code>，让每帧最多算一次、与浏览器绘制节奏对齐；二是用 <code>passive: true</code> 注册滚动监听，告诉浏览器你不会 <code>preventDefault</code>，从而不阻塞滚动合成。要避免的反模式是在滚动回调里同步读取 <code>getBoundingClientRect</code> 或 <code>offsetHeight</code>——那会强制同步布局，把滚动拖垮（机制见 <a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/layout-reflow\">布局与回流</a>）。测量应当发生在渲染之后、通过 <code>ResizeObserver</code> 异步回收，而不是在滚动的热路径上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个最小实现骨架\">一个最小实现骨架</h2><p>把上面的逻辑收成伪代码，定高场景下窗口计算极其简洁：<code>start = floor(scrollTop / itemHeight)</code>，<code>end = ceil((scrollTop + clientHeight) / itemHeight)</code>，<code>offset(start) = start * itemHeight</code>，<code>totalSize = N * itemHeight</code>。这就是 <a href=\"fixed-height\">定高虚拟化</a> 的全部数学。不定高场景把这几个乘除法替换成「前缀和 + 二分查找」，其余框架完全一致，这是 <a href=\"variable-height\">不定高与测量</a> 的主题。换句话说，本篇的坐标系是通用的，两种场景只是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>offset</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{offset}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的计算方式不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>窗口计算的输入是 <code>scrollTop</code>、<code>clientHeight</code>、各项高度，输出是可见索引区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>start</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>end</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{start}, \\text{end}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">start</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">end</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>三条不变量必须始终维持：总高度精确、偏移一致、区间完整覆盖可视区。</li>\n<li>窗口内项的摆放有绝对定位与「占位 + transform 滑块」两种，后者对合成更友好。</li>\n<li>滚动热路径要用 rAF 对齐帧、passive 监听，绝不同步读几何触发强制布局。</li>\n<li>定高与不定高共享同一坐标系，唯一差别是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>offset</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{offset}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 用乘法还是前缀和。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"fixed-height\">定高虚拟化</a> — 本篇公式在恒定行高下的 O(1) 特例。</li>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"variable-height\">不定高与测量</a> — 把 offset 换成前缀和 + 二分。</li>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"../techniques/overscan-buffer\">过扫描缓冲区</a> — 区间连续性不变量的有意松弛。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/layout-reflow\">布局与回流</a> — 为何滚动热路径不能同步读几何。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可视区与窗口计算：由 scrollTop 求出该渲染哪一段","id":"可视区与窗口计算-由-scrolltop-求出该渲染哪一段"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三个不变量","id":"三个不变量"},{"level":2,"text":"如何摆放窗口内的项","id":"如何摆放窗口内的项"},{"level":2,"text":"滚动事件的节流与时序","id":"滚动事件的节流与时序"},{"level":2,"text":"一个最小实现骨架","id":"一个最小实现骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"虚拟滚动、分页与无限滚动：三种应对长列表的取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/foundations/virtual-vs-pagination"},"next":{"title":"定高虚拟化：所有算式都退化成乘除法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/windowing/fixed-height"}}